WEBVTT

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:02.990
This is the real PriPara!

00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:06.450
It's the first time I've seen PriPara TV look so great!

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:08.940
They said PriPara had gone back to "normal"!

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.790
I can't believe she tried to become a Vocal Doll.

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:14.570
Come back Hibiki-sama!

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.460
Fuwari-chan and Toriko-san too!

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:18.770
And Ham-senpai!

00:00:18.770 --> 00:00:20.770
Come back!

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:56.130
Ring the Bell of Miracles!

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:05.060
Climb Hibiki-tori!

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:08.430
The fact that you lost doesn't matter, just keep climbing-tori!

00:02:09.010 --> 00:02:11.100
Hold on! But on second thought it might be impossible!

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:13.130
Life isn't so generous-tori!

00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:15.030
Pray you don't have to say goodbye-tori!

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:16.690
Hold on with all your might-tori!

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:17.400
It won't end happily!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.420
Fuwari...

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:21.140
Can you shut that bird up for a minute?

00:02:21.140 --> 00:02:22.820
Toriko, be quiet please!

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:23.950
Fuwari...

00:02:25.390 --> 00:02:30.080
Curly-chan, I'm fine so let me go...

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:33.180
If you don't, we'll all fall!

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:35.220
She's right

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:36.840
Hibiki-san!

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:39.270
Curly-chan is so kind!

00:02:39.270 --> 00:02:40.700
She really cares about me...

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:43.680
Please will you two be quiet!

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:48.050
Somebody said that sacrifice is necessary for a revolution-tori!

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:50.170
I understand that I must...

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:53.300
PLEASE BE QUIET-NATU!

00:02:58.240 --> 00:02:59.510
Sorry!

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:02.300
So you liked that sentence ender after all...

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.370
Hello-natu!

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:08.100
It's a miracle!

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.370
Miracle?

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:13.760
You all who won the Spring Dream Idol Grand Prix,

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:18.410
that is the five member of the Princess Team who

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:21.830
did a Dream Theater concert and rang five bells.

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:23.850
I see-nano!

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.690
I understand.

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:26.750
But...

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:30.190
To become a Princess Team you're one cord short!

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:31.740
Eh!?

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:34.520
The cord that we all won...

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:37.540
The Dream Parade Princess of the Seasons cord...

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:39.410
And summer.

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:40.250
Winter!

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:43.050
Spring, spring-pri...

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.770
There's one too many spring cords!

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:48.090
And no autumn cord

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:50.140
Ah, so that's the problem.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:53.090
Leave it to the Great Angel-nano!

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:54.800
What are you gonna do?

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:57.700
Well first I want to eat ten nikuman-nano!

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.880
I've had this for a while, but

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.470
I removed Hibiki's name

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:06.710
so anyone can use it!

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:10.520
and what belongs to Mikan, belongs to us too.

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:15.060
I'm sure that Aroma will look cute like a nikuman in my cord-nano!

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:17.400
Stop those cursed thoughts!

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.260
So, everything's solved!

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:22.010
Yay!

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:31.540
Garu!

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:33.150
Garuru, Unicorn!

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:35.150
Falulu! Are you okay?

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:36.710
Do you have any injuries?

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.090
Now now, Unicorn.

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:41.930
Only Maho-chan and Fuwari are in danger.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.590
Thank goodness!

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:47.890
I was mislead, but thank goodness!

00:04:57.120 --> 00:05:00.480
There are only happy idols in PriPara.

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:04.670
Those idols will make you happy.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:09.570
Because of this, I will protect PriPara with all my might!

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:11.080
...is what he said.

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:16.920
Enter! Dream Theater Concert!

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:22.340
Scan the My Tickets required for your cord.

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:24.970
You can scan your friend tickets too.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:27.680
Cord change start!

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:34.390
A pure-white silk dress, fit for a princess,

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:36.490
floral and vibrant!

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:39.110
Dream Parade Princess Cord!

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:45.980
A sweet-colored dress perfect for a warm spring,

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:47.740
this cord is in full bloom!

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:50.240
Spring Dream Parade Cord!

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:55.480
Like a vibrant sunflower,

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:58.380
the frills based on goldfish are really unique!

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:01.300
Summer Dream Parade Cord!

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:07.610
Mysterious like the moon covering a dark autumn night,

00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:09.870
elegant with large pearls!

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:12.520
Autumn Dream Parade Cord!

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:17.600
Snow crystals are the basis of winter,

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:20.930
combined with voluptuous fair, gorgeous!

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:23.400
Winter Dream Parade Cord!

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:32.280
Everyone!

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:35.080
Join hearts with us!

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:39.910
And bring a miracle greater than any angel or devil!

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:52.320
Making Drama, switch on!

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:54.290
Tension Max!

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:04.720
Capisce!

00:08:11.790 --> 00:08:17.370
Let's go together! PriPara Dream Fantasy!

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:20.590
Airy Change!

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:26.760
Gold Airy!

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:29.450
Gold Airy!

00:08:35.690 --> 00:08:37.160
Thanks!

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:40.110
Thank you-pri!

00:08:45.320 --> 00:08:47.600
Tension Max!!!

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:55.180
The miracle bell has revealed itself!

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:59.170
Everyone! Align your dreams with the bell toll!

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:02.540
Everyone's wishes

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:04.410
together as one!

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:07.650
Ring! Charm Bell!

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:11.390
Bring about a miracle, with our combined strength!

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.170
It's a miracle!

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:28.910
Where is this?

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:30.650
Ah, Curly-chan!

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:36.950
(Ajimi noises)

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:10.740
I'm back!

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:13.350
Keep your eyes on me-daVinci!

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:16.630
It's been a while everyone!

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.340
Thank god you were okay Ham-senpai!

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:21.100
Welcome back Toriko-nekon.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:24.150
Hibiki!

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:27.060
Thanks, I lose.

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:30.180
CelePara was the lie.

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:33.180
You can punish me any way you wish

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:36.490
We don't care about that!

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.160
But...

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:42.670
I'm on the side of the idols, what do you wish?

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:45.820
I see...

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:52.490
I lose, but I will guarantee the future of PriPara!

00:10:54.830 --> 00:10:58.130
That's what Louis XVI of France said-nekon.

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:06.410
That's great, Maho-chan.

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:09.260
What should I do with this?

00:11:09.950 --> 00:11:13.190
I'm worried that something bad may still happen.

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:13.890
Garu!

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:21.160
Garuru! Spit it out!

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.200
No-garu!

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:24.330
Garuru will become big again at her concert!

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:32.730
Now, the Dream Parade is starting!

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.500
We're up first! It's like a dream!

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:54.750
We're up first-pri!

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:56.070
It goes without saying!

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:59.610
You should thank me, we're only up first because I'm here!

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:02.280
There is no mistake in the Devil's judgement-dearu.

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:05.390
TL Note: Pun
The food of an angel is nikuman-nano!

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:07.150
Dim sun is good too-nano!

00:12:07.150 --> 00:12:08.740
Thanks everyone!

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:10.110
Lala-chan!

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:10.740
You're all wonderful!

00:12:10.740 --> 00:12:12.460
Sophie-sama!

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:15.490
Everyone fought so hard for this-kuma!

00:12:15.490 --> 00:12:16.970
They did so well-usa!

00:12:16.970 --> 00:12:18.420
They did so well-nekon!

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:22.520
Summer, Autumn, Winter, Spring. It was a long battle!

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.290
Encore Time!

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:27.140
Everything began from a summer adventure!

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:29.460
Dressing Flower!

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:34.730
Dream Theatre Live, switch on!

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:54.850
Airy Change!

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:06.240
Cyalume Airy!

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.260
It's an unforgettable summer adventure!

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.300
Cosmic, let's go!

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:18.620
Da Vinci!

00:14:19.590 --> 00:14:23.050
Dream Theatre Live, switch on!

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:35.850
Airy Change!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:44.710
Cyalume Airy!

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:48.360
Omu-omurice!

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:53.050
Dream Theatre Live, switch on!

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:15.680
Airy Change!

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:24.020
Gold Airy!

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:28.000
What a WonderPri World!

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:39.660
Next is this song for those who battled so hard to become the Princess of the Seasons,

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:44.120
The Parade Climax! Dream Theater Number One!

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:47.910
Dream Parade Live, switch on!

00:19:08.610 --> 00:19:10.980
Airy Change!

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:16.170
Gold Airy!

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.640
I love you all!

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:33.290
PriPara will be a forever shining star!

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:35.410
I love you-pri!

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:41.240
Welcome to Walpriparagis Nacht!

00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:43.550
And to an Angel's blessing-nano!

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:45.870
I love you!

00:19:45.870 --> 00:19:48.930
Lighting speed! The light cleanses all!

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:51.040
Isn't that a bit of a personal explanation?

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.050
Max!

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:53.900
Relax!

00:19:53.990 --> 00:19:55.840
Everyone fly!

00:19:56.600 --> 00:19:58.900
It's the first time I've seen something like this!

00:20:04.230 --> 00:20:05.970
Everyone come join us!

00:20:21.280 --> 00:20:22.460
It's amazing!

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:29.200
The magnificent flight of the devil-dearu!

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:35.140
We're all friends! We're all idols!

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:37.130
Capisce!
